; AurumHydra - AurumHydra_5x_month.set (goal mode, one 5x round) on FTMO's symbol names, for the month series on
; Terminal 16 (queue j8). The goal inputs below are the 5x preset's, unchanged; only the 16 symbol names differ.
; Without the names the EA finds no XAUUSD.pc and OnInit fails, so every month's report is empty (job j7, 2026-10-17).
; Inputs not listed keep the EA's defaults (run-tester.ps1 writes the source defaults first).
InpGold=XAUUSD
InpYen=USDJPY
InpEuro=EURUSD
InpGridSymbol=AUDCAD
InpStocks=US500.cash
InpPound=GBPUSD
InpAussie=AUDUSD
InpLoonie=USDCAD
InpSwissy=USDCHF
InpFixCross1=AUDJPY
InpFixCross2=CADJPY
InpFixCross3=GBPJPY
InpMorn1=EURJPY
InpMorn2=GBPJPY
InpMorn3=CADJPY
InpNasdaq=US100.cash
InpGoalMult=5.0
InpGoalDays=23
InpGoalCap=50.0
InpGoalBold=false
InpGoalScale=2.5
InpGoalDayVolPct=1.56
InpGoalRepeat=false
InpMonthEndBoost=2.0
InpGoalStop=true
InpGoalRound=1
InpMaxDrawdownPct=0.0
InpBrakePct=0.0
